## Naming Conventions

### Variables y Functions
```typescript
// ✅ Bien
const userName = "John"
const isLoading = false
function getUserById(id: string) { }

// ❌ Mal
const u = "John"
const loading = false
function get(id) { }
```

### Classes y Types
```typescript
// ✅ Bien
class UserService { }
interface UserProfile { }
type Status = "active" | "inactive"

// ❌ Mal
class user_service { }
interface userProfile { }
```

### Constants
```typescript
// ✅ Bien
const MAX_RETRIES = 3
const API_BASE_URL = "https://api.example.com"

// ❌ Mal
const maxRetries = 3
const apiBaseUrl = "https://api.example.com"
```

### Files
```
✅ user-service.ts (kebab-case)
✅ user-profile.tsx
❌ UserService.ts
❌ userProfile.tsx
❌ user_service.ts
```

